# Basenames that must be symlinked from host libraries for the WSL2 / mesa
# graphics stack.  Consumed by ./gen-hostegl --profile=egl.
#
# PROVENANCE: harvested 2026-09-25 from the committed etc/hostegl/ symlink
# directory, which was built up by hand -- running skeleton apps and vkcube and
# recording what failed to load.  That is evidence, not a guess: do not prune
# an entry because it looks unnecessary, only because a run proved it is.
#
# One basename per line.  A trailing glob is allowed, and is how a
# version-suffixed driver library survives a driver upgrade.
#
# Entries the current host cannot supply are REPORTED, not silently skipped.
# As of the harvest, 29 of these were already dangling on an ubuntu 24.04 host
# (libicuuc.so.70, libLLVM-15.so.1, libelf-0.186.so and friends are 22.04-era).
# Left in deliberately: this list describes WSL2, and pruning it from an ubuntu
# host would discard the record rather than correct it.
dri
libbsd.so.0
libbsd.so.0.11.5
libdrm_amdgpu.so.1
libdrm_amdgpu.so.1.0.0
